@startuml
title UC-00 - Sign In
autonumber
actor User
boundary AuthenticationController as API
control AuthenticationService as Service
database UserAccountRepository as UserRepo
control PasswordHasher as Hasher
database SessionRepository as SessionRepo

User -> API: SignIn(username, password) [MS-01]
API -> Service: SignIn(ctx, command)
Service -> UserRepo: FindActiveByUsername(username)
UserRepo --> Service: UserAccount
Service -> Hasher: Verify(password, passwordHash) [MS-02]
Hasher --> Service: valid
Service -> Service: Build identity context [MS-03]
Service -> SessionRepo: Save(tokenHash, user, expiry) [MS-04]
SessionRepo --> Service: Session
Service --> API: opaque session token
API --> User: Set HttpOnly cookie; open app [MS-05]
@enduml
